# Bounds the suggest wizard to the pages of the record's site, matching the
# clause the TCA listener writes into every scoped relation field's
# foreign_table_where. Both surfaces read ###PAGE_TSCONFIG_IDLIST###, whose
# value SiteScopedRelationsPageTsConfigListener emits per field.
#
# The column is unqualified here while the listener's clause names the foreign
# table: the wizard queries one table at a time and this block is shared by
# every suggest field, whereas the dropdown's query joins and needs the
# qualifier. Same condition, each written for the query it lands in.
#
# TRAP: SuggestWizardController uses a field's own foreign_table_where only
# while TSconfig sets no addWhere. This block therefore disables that fallback
# for every suggest field in the installation, including tables this extension
# does not own — hence the language condition folded in below, which the three
# thuecat_ces flexform fields would otherwise lose.
TCEFORM.suggest.default.addWhere = AND {#pid} IN (###PAGE_TSCONFIG_IDLIST###) AND {#sys_language_uid} IN (0, -1)
